---
kind: quest
id: isolationQuests
---

<quest id="hushWing" title="Let the wing sleep" start="visited('room.isolation')" fail="@dead">
  <objective id="edith" title="Tell Edith it is not three" done="holds(calmed(edith))"/>
  <objective id="walter" title="Give Mr. Pell his visiting day" done="holds(calmed(walter))"/>
  <objective id="june" title="Call June by her name" done="holds(calmed(june))" by="@lateNight"/>
  <on event="questActive">
    @nell{mono}: Three beds. Three people who never got the round they were promised.
  </on>
  <on event="questComplete">
    @narrator: Down in the wing, three sets of breathing stop, one after the other, like lamps going out along a street.
  </on>
  <on event="questFailed">
    @june{os when="quest.hushWing.objectives.june.failed"}: It's three. You said you'd come before three.
  </on>
</quest>
